<title>POLAND: Beton Stal to vote on two share issues.</title>
<headline>Beton Stal to vote on two share issues.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shareholders of Polish builder Beton Stal SA will vote on June 17 on management's proposal to conduct two new share issues ex-rights, the company said in a statement on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Beton Stal said one issue of 150,000 to 300,000 shares would take part in dividends for 1997 and another issue of 300,000 to 500,000 shares would take part in dividends for 1998.</p>
<p>It gave no other details.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
